# A role's inner voice: asked at each pause and after each reply, never over the agent.
greeting Hi.
role devils_advocate
ladder off
reply Remote work = Why do you think so?
think everyone is more productive = {"notes": "claims remote work helps everyone", "thought": {"move": "challenge", "urgency": 2, "why": "a sweeping claim", "line": "Everyone?"}}
think # The conversation = {"notes": "", "thought": null}
0.2 listen
1.0 voice on
1.6 partial remote work is better
2.2 voice off
2.4 voice on
3.0 partial remote work is better because everyone is more productive
3.6 voice off
4.8 final Remote work is better because everyone is more productive.
14 end
